NC Digital offers fully managed starter websites for small businesses across South Wales — a complete website package built, hosted, and managed for you from **£20 per month inc. VAT**. Based in Merthyr Tydfil, we work with businesses from Cardiff and Swansea to the Valleys and beyond.

## A professional website without the hassle

Not every South Wales business needs a complex, fully custom-built website. Our Managed Starter Website service gives you a clean, professional online presence that ranks on Google and generates enquiries — without you lifting a finger after setup.

Every plan includes a professionally built website, your own custom domain, fast UK hosting with SSL, daily backups, and ongoing technical management. We add new pages every month, building your Google visibility consistently over time.

## Plans from £20/month inc. VAT

- **Starter — £20/month inc. VAT** — 5 new pages added per month
- **Growth — £35/month inc. VAT** — 10 new pages added per month
- **Scale — £50/month inc. VAT** — unlimited new pages added per month

See our [managed starter websites service](/services/managed-starter-websites/) for full plan details. For businesses that need more control or a fully bespoke design, our [web design South Wales](/web-design-south-wales/) and web development South Wales services are the better fit.

